      "changes": [
        "Visible bell-pepper version with a separate 6 g frozen jalapeno dose, retaining roasting and skin removal with unknown loss. Ready-made 400 g corn tortillas replace 280 g masa plus dough salt, without yield equivalence. Standard/extended mozzarella is explicitly 120 g drained cheese, not as-sold mass. Frozen coriander cooks in the cream instead of raw salad; all sauce and dressing are retained."
